      "approach": "Memoization and Recursive\n - We use a memoization array to store the results of the previous tribonacci numbers\n - We then use an recursive approach to calculate the nth tribonacci number",
      "timeComplexity": "O(n)",
      "spaceComplexity": "O(n)",
      "code": "<pre><code class=\"language-typescript\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">memoizationRecursiveSolution</span> = (<span class=\"hljs-params\">n</span>) =&gt; {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> result = <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">new</span> <span class=\"hljs-title class_\">Array</span>(n);\n  result[<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>;\n  result[<span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n  result[<span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>] = <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">nthTribonacci</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"><span class=\"hljs-attr\">n</span>: <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span></span>): <span class=\"hljs-built_in\">number</span> {\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (n &lt;= <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>) {\n      <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> result[n];\n    }\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">nthTribonacci</span>(n - <span class=\"hljs-number\">1</span>) + <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">nthTribonacci</span>(n - <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>) + <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">nthTribonacci</span>(n - <span class=\"hljs-number\">3</span>);\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">nthTribonacci</span>(n);\n};\n</code></pre>",
